msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/indexAlgorithmFunctionality|http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label"
msgid "indexAlgorithm is functional"
msgstr "indexAlgorithm 具有函数性"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/indexAlgorithmFunctionality|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "Asserts on the canonical carrier that gmeow:indexAlgorithm is functional: a vector index is built with exactly one approximate-nearest-neighbour structure, a single build-time commitment fixing how that index is searched."
msgstr "在规范载体上断言 gmeow:indexAlgorithm 是函数性的:一个向量索引恰好以一种近似最近邻结构构建,这是构建时确定的单一承诺,决定了该索引的检索方式。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/relationshipSourceFunctionality|http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label"
msgid "relationshipSource is functional"
msgstr "relationshipSource 具有函数性"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/relationshipSourceFunctionality|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "Asserts on the canonical carrier that gmeow:relationshipSource is functional: an extracted relationship has exactly one entity description at its tail, the single source endpoint of the directed edge."
msgstr "在规范载体上断言 gmeow:relationshipSource 是函数性的:一个抽取出的关系在其尾部恰好有一个实体描述——即该有向边唯一的源端点。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/relationshipTargetFunctionality|http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label"
msgid "relationshipTarget is functional"
msgstr "relationshipTarget 具有函数性"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/relationshipTargetFunctionality|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "Asserts on the canonical carrier that gmeow:relationshipTarget is functional: an extracted relationship has exactly one entity description at its head, the single target endpoint of the directed edge."
msgstr "在规范载体上断言 gmeow:relationshipTarget 是函数性的:一个抽取出的关系在其头部恰好有一个实体描述——即该有向边唯一的目标端点。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/summarizesCommunityFunctionality|http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label"
msgid "summarizesCommunity is functional"
msgstr "summarizesCommunity 具有函数性"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/summarizesCommunityFunctionality|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "Asserts on the canonical carrier that gmeow:summarizesCommunity is functional: a community summary condenses exactly one community, the single cluster whose members and chunks the summary was generated from."
msgstr "在规范载体上断言 gmeow:summarizesCommunity 是函数性的:一份社区摘要恰好浓缩自一个社区,即该摘要据以生成的那唯一一个簇的成员与分块。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/indexAlgorithmFunctionality|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/useWhen"
msgid "Use when the native coherence gate must enforce that gmeow:indexAlgorithm names exactly one value; this record is the canonical carrier the gate joins, so the obligation is reasoned rather than restated on a shape surface."
msgstr "当原生一致性门必须强制 gmeow:indexAlgorithm 恰好命名一个值 时使用；该记录是门所连接的规范载体，因此该义务是被推理出来的，而非在形状表面上重述。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/indexAlgorithmFunctionality|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/avoidWhen"
msgid "Avoid this record when a second value would make the record ambiguous — retire the assertion instead of weakening it, and never mirror it as a hand-authored shape."
msgstr "当第二个值会使该记录产生歧义时避免使用该记录——应撤回该断言而非削弱它，且绝不将其复刻为手写形状。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/indexAlgorithmFunctionality|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/howToUse"
msgid "Read together with logic:characteristicSort: the pair (logic:characterizes gmeow:indexAlgorithm, logic:characteristicSort logic:functionalProperty) is the whole obligation, and the OWL grounding view projects the matching characteristic from it."
msgstr "与 logic:characteristicSort 一并阅读：(logic:characterizes gmeow:indexAlgorithm, logic:characteristicSort logic:functionalProperty) 这一对构成完整义务，OWL 基础视图据此投影出相应特征。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/indexAlgorithmFunctionality|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#example"
msgid "gmeow:indexAlgorithmFunctionality logic:characterizes gmeow:indexAlgorithm ."
msgstr "gmeow:indexAlgorithmFunctionality logic:characterizes gmeow:indexAlgorithm ."

